{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Giant`s Heart</strong> is a roguelike dungeon crawler with <strong>gardening</strong> elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/ece5a6b3c2a91a19c23aa1b6b095500e.poster.avif?t=1773630379\" width=960 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/ece5a6b3c2a91a19c23aa1b6b095500e.webm?t=1773630379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/ece5a6b3c2a91a19c23aa1b6b095500e.mp4?t=1773630379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESTROY THE HEART</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass through 3 unique biomes and reach the heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/a3a69b65f0beaf7a922e0126ab938940.avif?t=1773630379\" width=960 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your backpack with artifacts and create the strongest and fastest build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials and plant seeds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW A GARDEN - BECOME STRONGER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between expeditions, grow plants - they make you stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/f3815df1be3cfc477ec722890ec9a7a6.poster.avif?t=1773630379\" width=960 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/f3815df1be3cfc477ec722890ec9a7a6.webm?t=1773630379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/f3815df1be3cfc477ec722890ec9a7a6.mp4?t=1773630379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft new weapons and upgrade old ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/e1827604b2ebc40049d62aedaa241e4c.poster.avif?t=1773630379\" width=960 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/e1827604b2ebc40049d62aedaa241e4c.webm?t=1773630379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/e1827604b2ebc40049d62aedaa241e4c.mp4?t=1773630379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME IS THE MAIN CURRENCY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make critical decisions where the main stake is time - a currency more valuable than gold and artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/5d2c7dfd6c68cf05ba412a70ba7cf9e3.poster.avif?t=1773630379\" width=960 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/5d2c7dfd6c68cf05ba412a70ba7cf9e3.webm?t=1773630379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771190/extras/5d2c7dfd6c68cf05ba412a70ba7cf9e3.mp4?t=1773630379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Giant's Brain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771190/7b235d8f5186d871aa408228268eae22a209d287